<title>USA: BOXING-PASTRANA TAKES IBF JUNIOR FLYWEIGHT TITLE FROM CARBAJAL.</title>
<headline>BOXING-PASTRANA TAKES IBF JUNIOR FLYWEIGHT TITLE FROM CARBAJAL.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-01-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mauricio Pastrana of Colombia captured the International Boxing Federation junior flyweight title from American Michael Carbajal by a split decision on Saturday.</p>
</text>
